{"product":{"id":8960553222420,"title":"PROJECT MANAGEMENT","body_html":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eEngineering project management is one of the determinants of project success, and it is no longer a luxury that can be overlooked. Many state sector projects and private sector projects are in dire need of someone to represent them in managing projects with high professionalism.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eThe Office of Future Cities is distinguished by the availability of engineering expertise in various fields and projects. This qualifies him to undertake the management of multidisciplinary engineering projects. We can handle the following services:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eEstablishing project management offices.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eProject management on behalf of clients.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eStudying, structuring and engineering the procedures of sectors and departments.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003ePreparing and creating management systems for engineering projects.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eDeveloping technical systems for project management.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eProvide technical and technical support.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","vendor":"ThemeDevOps","product_type":"","created_at":"2024-01-28T12:34:04+03:00","handle":"project-management","updated_at":"2026-11-03T15:42:27+03:00","published_at":"2024-01-28T12:34:04+03:00","template_suffix":"service","published_scope":"web","tags":"","variants":[{"id":47594856317204,"product_id":8960553222420,"title":"Default Title","price":"0.00","sku":"","position":2,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2024-01-28T12:34:05+03:00","updated_at":"2026-11-03T15:42:27+03:00","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":0,"image_id":null,"weight":0.0,"weight_unit":"kg","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"SAR","compare_at_price_currency":"","quantity_price_breaks":[]}],"options":[{"id":11287972118804,"product_id":8960553222420,"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}],"images":[{"id":44241342890260,"product_id":8960553222420,"position":1,"created_at":"2024-01-28T12:34:04+03:00","updated_at":"2024-01-28T12:34:06+03:00","alt":null,"width":1000,"height":1000,"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/